      "narrative": null,
      "content": "漆 World Health Organization \n^ Organisation mondiale de la Santé \nEXECUTIVE BOARD \nAgenda item 9 \nEB93/Conf.Paper No.5 \nNinety-third Session \n21 January 1994 \nJoint and cosponsored United Nations \nprogramme on HIV/AIDS \n(Draft resolution proposed by Professor Munewer Bertan, \nProfessor J.M.S. Caldeira da Silva, Professor I. Chernozemsky, \nDr V. Devo, Mrs P. Herzog, Dr J. Larivière, Dr J.G.S. Makumbi， \nProfessor J. Mbede，Dr E. Nakamura, Dr Ngo Van Hop, \nDr B.L. Shrestha and Mr J.F. Varder) \nThe Executive Board, \nTaking into account resolution WHA46.37 adopted by the Forty-sixth World Health Ass",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "A 1994 Executive Board draft resolution, proposed by several Board members, backing a joint and cosponsored United Nations programme on HIV/AIDS along the lines of the consensus option set out in documents EB93/27 and EB93/INF.DOC./5. It stresses the need for better multisectoral coordination and asks that the heads of UNICEF, UNDP, UNFPA, UNESCO and the World Bank be invited to have their governing bodies join the Board in this step.",
